s/cli.md in three places: \"Install an application package\", \"What it\nneeds\" and \"dap clone --archive\". The later head merges the earlier\none. Do not edit docs/get-dap.md. Main is now 810905c9.\n\nNo version, publication, deployment or get-dap change, as you state.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}